b_tag\" ><strong>A Life That Deepens with Every Playthrough</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ach scenario has multiple possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices, skill builds, and approach to money management can dramatically change how the story plays out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more Sky’s life expands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—If you reach for the sky, one day you’ll touch it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Sky’s future with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/65e2f4cacc8dc823f97a23175da861ae.avif?t=1775049293\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p>", "short_description": "SKY THE SCRAPER is an action-packed adventure about Sky, a young man who pursues his uncertain dreams while working as a building window cleaner. Through exciting wire action and daily life management, endure two months of hard living and pave the way for Sky's future.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/header.jpg?t=1775049293", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775049293", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775049293", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 or AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or AMD Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended":